---
import PortfolioLayout from '../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro';
---

<PortfolioLayout
	title="About"
	description="About Prince Kurt Sherlock G. Ceria, a Computer Engineering student at the University of the Immaculate Conception."
	currentPath="/about/"
>
	<section class="max-w-3xl">
		<p class="font-mono text-sm text-brand-neon">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p>
		<h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Still learning, still exploring.</h1>
		<div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-brand-muted">
			<p>
				My name is Prince Kurt Sherlock G. Ceria. I am a 4th-year Computer Engineering student at the
				University of the Immaculate Conception in Davao City, Philippines, and I expect to graduate
				around March-April 2027.
			</p>
			<p>
				I am early in my engineering journey and do not claim to know everything. I have worked with
				Python, Java, HTML, and CSS, and have tried tools including Bubble.io, Kaggle, Google Colab,
				EasyEDA, and Proteus. I enjoy learning through coursework, team projects, and hands-on
				experimentation.
			</p>
			<p>
				I also enjoy exploring Linux. I have tried Ubuntu, Arch Linux, CachyOS, EndeavourOS, Manjaro,
				and Debian, and currently use Pop!_OS.
			</p>
			<p>
				My current academic projects include an RFID-enabled library management system and
				NoduleCare, a team research project exploring computer vision for thoracic CT scans.
			</p>
		</div>
		<a
			class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg border border-brand-border px-5 py-3 font-medium transition hover:border-brand-neon hover:text-brand-neon"
			href="/contact/">Contact me</a
		>
	</section>
</PortfolioLayout>
